WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,200
This is a shower gel for scrubbing

2
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,840
That one is for wiping your face. Don’t use it to confuse me. I understand that there is no such thing.

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:04,760
what does this mean

4
00:00:04,760 --> 00:00:08,200
It can actually produce tap water. Do you have it there? No.

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:09,280
We all dig water from wells

6
00:00:09,280 --> 00:00:12,640
It doesn't matter how poor you are. Now that you know it, go and wash it.

7
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:15,320
It is indeed the land of gods and phoenixes

8
00:00:15,320 --> 00:00:16,240
Rinse with hot water

9
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,480
Feel very comfortable

10
00:00:17,480 --> 00:00:18,480
my god

11
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,040
This is so handsome, right?

12
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:21,800
How in the world can he be so handsome?

13
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,240
Such a manly person

14
00:00:23,240 --> 00:00:26,480
And let myself meet again and again

15
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,380
Why is there a noise up there?

16
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:32,140
There are a few little yellow-haired little girls living up there.

17
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:34,100
Do it like this every day or just play songs

18
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:35,780
Or just dance over there and make it too noisy.

19
00:00:35,780 --> 00:00:37,260
It's so noisy that I can't sleep even if I talk about it

20
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:38,340
Are they right?

21
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,260
Of course it's wrong

22
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:40,180
This is disturbing the people

23
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:41,980
Didn't you look for them? Did you?

24
00:00:41,980 --> 00:00:43,940
I've told them several times

25
00:00:43,940 --> 00:00:45,420
I also told the apartment management.

26
00:00:45,420 --> 00:00:46,580
but they don't listen

27
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:48,100
And the last time I went to talk to them,

28
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,540
She even called me an old woman

29
00:00:49,540 --> 00:00:50,820
That's their fault

30
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,990
How old are you this year?

31
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:57,700
What's wrong with me this year, thirty-thirty? Is thirty very old?
